  },
  "description": "The self-hosted iroh DNS server deCDN nodes publish to and clients resolve through (roles/iroh_dns_server): pkarr publishes, the record store, DNS requests and lookups, HTTP, logs. Metrics job=\"iroh-dns-server\" as the grafana_alloy role ships them.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "DNS server",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "title": "iroh-dns-server",
      "description": "Whether Prometheus can scrape iroh-dns-server (`up`). Down: nodes cannot publish their records and clients cannot resolve them under its origin. An instant query: with the host or its agent gone it shows no data, never a stale UP.",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"iroh-dns-server\", instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "title": "Publishes, 24h",
      "description": "pkarr puts in the last 24 hours, whether they changed the stored record or not (dns_server_pkarr_publish_update_total + dns_server_pkarr_publish_noop_total). Every node republishes every 5 minutes, about 288 a day each.",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
